      "id": "runtime-dirs-not-shipped",
      "lines": [
        "catalog/ is read at run time and is not in the shipped file set: lib/Service/Catalog.php:22 reaches it through __DIR__.",
        "  A release ships only the paths of the keep set (the ncmake core and ncmake.mk), so the tarball lacks it and the app fails in the code that reads it, while the build and the packing pass. In ncmake.mk, keep_extra += catalog ships it."
      ]
